<pṛ0 1a> oṃśrīsvātmaneguraveśivāyoṃnamaḥ śrīgaṇapatayenamaḥ viśvottīrṇaṃviśvamayaṃnāthamanaṃ
taṃsaccitsātātmānamakhaṃḍaṃnikhilādyaṃ vedyaṃvedyaiḥkovidavaryaiḥsuravaṃdyaṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamī
ḍegurumīśaṃ (1) nityaṃsatyaṃnirguṇamekaṃguṇapūrṇaṃvṛtyaṃstutyaṃkṛtyavidhijñaiḥkṛtakṛtyaṃ cid vi
śrāṃtaṃśrāṃtavikalpaṃbhagavaṃtaṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (2) yenadhvāṃtaṃdhvaṃsitamaṃtaḥstha
maśeṣaṃtīrthyānāṃsacchāsanasūktairanugītaḥ jñātvāsarvaiḥsvātmagataṃjyotirayaṃtaṃkaulādhī
śaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (3) devairdṛśyodivyavapuryohimaśailehaimaprakhyaḥsomakalābhūṣita 
śīrṣaḥ divyaugheśohaimavatīśliṣṭatanustaṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (4) siddhaiḥ
sādhyaiḥkhemunividyādharavṛṃdaiḥsevyaṃśuddhaṃsiddhivadanyaṃpratibuddhaṃ siddhīśānaṃsphītavibhūtiṃpa
rasiddhyākaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (5) śāṃtaṃghoraṃvīravarairvaṃditapādaṃbhāṃtaṃsvāṃte
vātunidhiṃbhaktiyutānāṃ kāṃtaṃkāṃtyādityasamānaṃkaruṇābdhiṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamī
ḍegurumīśaṃ (6) kaiścidbrahmadhyāyatīśomunibhiryaḥsvātmācānyairyogibhirātmārpaṇayo
gāt martyaugheṃdraḥkopiparastaṃjagatīnaṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (7) sāṃkhye

<pṛ0 1ba> khyātoniṣkrayekaḥpuruṣoyaḥsaṃkhyāvidbhiḥkaiścidameyaḥprakṛtiṃsvāṃ sṛṣṭiṃdṛṣṭvākārayatekā
raṇakīrtyākaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (8) yonyāyajñairbhāvakadaṃbaṃparibhāvyabhartābhoktā
viśvavihartākhilakartā saṃhartaiṣāṃsādhuvinītānumitastaṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (9) 
viśvātmāyastaijasamūrtiḥpratibhāḍhyojñānaprauḍhasturyadaśāsthastadatītaḥ śrutyaṃtajñairjñāyata
eṣaśrutirūpaḥkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (10) śaṃbhuḥsaṃbhukṛtyavibhāvībhavabhavyopyaṃbho
jākṣoyovibhurīśādvayavidbhiḥ sarvajñaḥsaddaiśikamukhyodvayiṣṭaḥkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegu
rumīśaṃ (11) yanmūrtiḥkepuṣkarakośekarapadmairmudrāvyāpyābhītivarāṃkāmṛtapadme tryakṣādattedhyā
tṛjanebhyaḥpraṇidhānākaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (12) dikṣātmāyodīkṣakarūpopyavi
dīkṣomaṃtrākramyomāṃtrikamūrtiḥparamaṃtraḥsarvācāryaḥsarvagāryaḥsmṛtāptaiḥkaulādhīśaṃsā
hibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (13) śaktyānaṃtaṃśāṃbhavavidyāṃbudhimūrmyābrāhmyārūḍhaḥstautiviriṃciḥ
samaheṃdraḥ viṣvagvarṇyaṃviśvapatiṃyaṃpravimuktaṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (14) 
bhargabrahmannāyakaviṣṇoparamātmandātarmātardevigurotātasakhītvaṃ pāhītthaṃyogīyate

<pṛ0 2a> kaḥparabhaktaiḥkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (15) sarvottaṃsaṃsajjanaśiṣyāśritamarcyepū
rṇānaṃdecidghanasiddhaṃparabhānāt viśrāmārāmeviniṣaṇaṃśaśipīṭhekaulādhīśaṃsāhi
bamīḍegurumīśaṃ (16) kṛtsnasyāṃtarbhātisamiddhenijasiddhesvasminyasminmaṃgaladīpe
ramateyaḥ bāhyaṃboddhābhāsyagavākṣairapibhāsyaṃkaulādhīśaṃsāhibamīḍegurumīśaṃ (17) eta
tsadguruvaṃdanaṃpravidadhaukauleśvaraḥkaulikaḥ padyairmattamayūravṛttaracitairjyotiṣprakāśābhidhaḥ
śrīmatsāhibapādabhaktisudhayāmattomayūroyathā (18) itiśrīmacchrīgurustutiḥ || 
oṃśrīdevyainamaḥ sākṣātkṛtyanijaṃsvarūpamamalaṃyadbhātivipruṇmayaṃ hitvābhrāṃtimatiṃ
maheśitiyodevarṣimartyaiḥstutaḥ baddhānbhaktajanānvimocayatisatkāraṇyadṛṣṭyākṣaṇāt
kauleśaṃkulaśekharaṃguruvaraṃdhyāyāmitaṃsāhibaṃ (1) yasyaikasyavibhorvibhāvikasatātprode
tiviśvaṃsthitiṃ vyāpnotyaṃśunimeṣaṇātkṣaṇamapipratyastamāyātyaho svacchaṃdaṃsatatoditaṃ 
sakalagaṃpūrṇaṃviśuddhaṃsadā naumyānaṃdanidhiṃcidaṃbaramaṇiṃśrīsāhibaṃtaṃśivaṃ (2) ādā
vādhārapadmātpratibhuvanamalaṃbhāsayansvaprabhābhiḥ śritvāmaṃdārabiṃdākaramamṛtavapuḥpāda

<pṛ0 2ba> kaṃjasrutairyaḥ siṃcanpīyūṣavarṣaiḥsuramunipitṛkānkārmikāṃstīrthyasaṃghān brahmāṃḍāgāraśaṃ
bhuḥsphuratiparamahastadbhajesāhibākhyaṃ (3) dhātāyasyapadābjavaṃdanarasātsargaṃtanotīśate vi
ṣṇurjiṣṇusakhācarakṣatipadāṃbhojārcanātsaṃhṛtiṃ rudraśceśasadāśivautrijagatobhrūbhaṃgiśiṣṭyā
pidhāṃ kāruṇyaṃtanutovibhuṃparaśivaṃtaṃsāhibaṃtvārcaye (4) tvaṃsvātaṃtryaruciścabhaktajanatādhīnā
tmakastvaṃprabho tvaṃviśvāśrayatattvabhūtijanitātvaṃtattvatonāśritaḥ tvaṃkṛtsnajñavidhātṛtādyava
yavītvaṃkaṃcukāṃtarpitastvaṃkāruṇyanidhistvapāramahimāśrīsāhibaṃtāṃstuve (5) kāyaḥkāya
tikalpitaḥkilaśilākalpāhṛṣīkavrajā hṛṣyaṃtiprabhavobhavasthitilayānbhāveṣukartuṃ
sphuṭaṃ prāṇaḥprāṇatiyanmarīcikalayātaṃjīvajīvaṃśivaṃ cinnāthaṃsahajaṃnijaṃgurutamaṃdhāmāśra
yesāhibaṃ (6) māyāsuptasamastajaṃtutatiṣūjjāgartyajasraṃcayaḥ ṣaḍbhāvāṃvikṛtiṃvivartayati
yosaunirvikāraḥsvayaṃ ekonekatayāsvaśaktilaharīvṛṃdairnijaṃkhelayannaikākārivāṃbudhairanu
mitastaṃbhāvayesāhibaṃ (7) kartātarkanayevimuktapuruṣaḥsāṃkhyejinaḥsaugate śavdātmādhvani
śāsanevidhiyutaṃkarmāyanejaimineḥ brahmaikaṃśrutimastakeharirayaṃyogīyatevaiṣṇave śaiveśaṃbhura

<pṛ0 3a> śeṣarūpamatulaṃtaṃsāhibaṃsaṃśraye (8) nityāhlādamayaṃnirāmayamamuṃnirdhūtatīrthyāṃhasaṃ nirdvaṃdvāka
lanaṃnirādinidhanaṃnirdvaitabodhātmakaṃ niḥspaṃdasphuritaṃniruttarakalāśliṣṭaṃguruṃnimalaṃ ni
śśeṣāśrayamīśvaraṃnirupamaṃnityaṃbhajesāhibaṃ (9) saṃviddyotavimarṣaharṣavapuṣānākeprakā
śyābhito yenaprāgdivisatyabodhabharitaṃtejaḥsamullāsitaṃ svaṃsvacchaṃpratibhāsvabhāvasubha
gaṃcordhyāṃprasaṃtupriyāñ śiṣyānkāruṇikaṃśivaṃnavatanuṃpreḍeguruṃsāhibaṃ (10) yanmūrtirbhuva
nemahātmabhiralaṃdhyeyāsahasracchade padmemūrdhnisitāṃbarātrinayanāsomāsanāsomabhāḥ ci
nmudrāvarapustakābhayakarāvāmārdhadevyaṃkitā bhaktānugrahatatparāparaśivaṃtaṃsāhibaṃbhāvaye 
(11) aṃtardhāyabhujaukalāṃcaśaśinorbhālekṣaṇaṃbhūtale soyaṃśaṃkaranāthevaviharannācārya
gātrasthitaḥ sākṣānnrūndayateparādvayadṛśāsaṃmuktamūrtyāgirā saccitsātaghanaṃnamāmipara
meśānaṃprabhuṃsāhibaṃ (12) yaḥpādadvayanirgalatparasudhādhārābhirārādhakān saṃtarpyāvirataṃpadā
bjaśaraṇāndāsānsvamebhyaḥsvabhaḥ svāmīsvarviṣayātiśāyimuditaṃdatteprabhutvaṃmahajjīva
nmuktivibhūṣitaṃparaśivaṃtaṃsāhibaṃsaṃstuve (13) tārātmābhavatārakomarayutairlokeśakeśeśva

<pṛ0 3ba> rairekoyokhilavāṅmayāmṛtanidhiściddharṣapūrṇodhruvaḥ brahmāṃḍādvipulopyaṇoraṇutamojyoti
stamojyotiṣāṃ svātmaikyātparimṛśyateparaśivaṃtaṃsaṃbhajesāhibaṃ (14) vāgyasmātpraṇatārtinā
śanapaṭumaṃdākinīveśvarādhṛtkāluṣyamṛjākṣamāmunimatāpūtāprasādāspadā srotovisṛti
bhāgavātaradaraṃtīrthārthisārthārcitā viśveśaṃgurusattamaṃśivakaraṃvaṃdevibhuṃsāhibaṃ (15) māyeyaṃ
mahitāpradhānamahilāsvātaṃtryalīlotsavā svāsvābhāvikabhāvabhāvapaṭaladvaitaprathādāyinī
yasyeśasyacakāstibhāvaviyutāḥkemohitānoyayā durbodhātmikayātriviṣṭapaguruṃtaṃsāhibaṃ
saṃśraye (16) lakṣmīryasyajagatprabhoravirataṃpādābjasaktāśayaistyaktākṛttrimarūpatopyakṛtakā
naṃdādṛḍhaṃsaṃśritā sphūrjadbhaktyavibhaktamuktivibhavātaṃpūrṇaśaktiṃprabhuṃśrīnāthaṃgurucakravartina
mahaṃnaumīśvaraṃsāhibaṃ (17) ākāśoḍuṣukāśatesitakaraḥsnigdhoyathāsevyate sarvarddhiścaja
nārdanaḥsuragaṇaiścaṃḍānalaujāstathā trailokyepikalāḍhyacaṃdrarucirovaṃdyoyīśodvayo mā
heśairbhajatāṃśaraṇyamaniśaṃtaṃsāhibaṃtvāṃstuve (18) śaṃbhustvaṃparaśaktimāṃstusakalakleśaikavai
śvānaraḥ saṃvartastvamanādyadainyagahanetvaṃkālakālomahān iṃdrastvaṃvaruṇānilaumadhuripuḥ

<pṛ0 4a> sābjopyakhaṃḍātmakastvāṃśrīsāhibamarcayāmisakalottīrṇaṃmaheśaṃguruṃ (19) caṃdrārkekṣaṇamaṣṭaśa
ktigiriśaṃdyomastakaṃnābhikhaṃ kukṣisthāṃbunidhiṃhutāśavadanaṃsūkṣmāmṛtābhāsitaṃ dikka
rṇaṃcaraṇakṣitiṃkhalujagatprāṇaṃtvakrūrātmakaṃ śrīnāthaṃsuvirājamadbhutatanutvāṃsāhivaṃbhāvaye
(20) śaṃkārāśyaśaniṃnabhotipṛthulaṃnityaṃnutaṃnirjaraiḥ śrīvaikuṃṭhapinākināyakamukhaiḥpīyūṣaha
rṣātmakaṃ yogāṃtāgninibhaṃjagadgurugarīyāṃsaṃhṛdisthaṃśivaṃ śāṃtyākrāṃtamanuttaraṃdhruvamajaṃ
vaṃdevibhuṃsāhibaṃ (21) śrīviśveśvarabhairavotikaruṇoharṣeśvarīsaṃyutaḥ sāmnāyāgamasampradā
yasumaṇīṃścopādidikṣuḥśritān avyaktopikṛpāvatāramamalaṃvyānaṃjabodhodadhiṃ yaṃkau
leśapatiṃviśālayaśasaṃjīyādasausāhibaḥ (22) yaḥśūnyākṛtipūrṇaśaktikhacitaḥśūnyā
layaḥsansudhā naṃdāḍhyobhuvanaṃpipartisakalaṃyonirguṇoniṣkalaḥ dvaitādvaitakalāśrayopimu
nibhiryogīśvarairgīyate cidrūpaṃgurupuṣkalaṃparaśivaṃtaṃsāhibaṃsaṃśraye (23) brahmāmnāyasarasva
tīśritamukhohaṃsasthitaḥprītimān drāksaṃkarṣaṇadaivatāgnimamahāsenādiyuktaḥsvayaṃ śrī
nāthaṃsatataṃgṛṇātijagatījaittraṃyamīḍyaṃgurormūrtisthaṃpraṇatosmitaṃparaśivaṃśrīsāhibaṃsarva

<pṛ0 4ba> śaḥ (24) maṃtrāmāṃtrikamaṃtryarūpabhagavandevādhidevaprabho śrīśrīkaulakuleśadeśikaparānaṃ
dādināthābhayaṃ śaktyāśliṣṭavapuḥprasannavadanodatsevaraṃcepsitaṃ nityaṃśrīparapādukāṃcaśi
vayorvāṃpūjayāmyānataḥ (25) pāśaidhodahanaṃhṛdutpalasudhāraśmiṃstuvetvāṃmṛḍaṃ dvaitādhvāṃtara
viṃtridhāmadharaṇiṃśrīsāhibaṃsadguruṃ pūjyāṃghreśivapālanātsuduritadhvaṃsāścakāmyānṛṇāt
smartṛṇāṃtriguṇādhipāvijayateśrīpādukāteśubhā (26) yodevatrayavarṇyavīryavibhavopyardheṃdu
lekhojjvalaḥ saṃcetyaughanirodhinādagaganāṃtasthomahāvyāpakaḥ cittattvaspṛgamoghaśaktiru
ditoyacconmanācetana stattvajñaiḥ praṇatositaṃparaśivaṃtvāṃsāhibaṃsaṃbhaje (27) kālākāradi
gādyakṛttavapuṣodhyānaṃnukiṃtevibho tvaṃviṣvagjagadathitārthajanakopyarcāvidhistekathaṃ ā
dikṣāṃtasuvarṇabhāsuratanoḥkātestutiḥsāhibaṃ satyaṃśāṃtamanuttamaṃguruvaraṃtaṃtvāṃprapadyeprabhuṃ
(28) snātvādaupariśuddhaviṃdusarasaściccaṃdrasāṃdrāmṛtaiḥ prokṣyādhāradharāṃsvabhāvakusumaisturyā
ṭavīdyotitaiḥ kṛtvānaṃdasudhaughapūrṇahṛdayānarghārghapātraṃsadā tvāṃdevyāsahadehadevanila
yenāthārcayesāhibaṃ (29) mūrkhobhijñatinākatīhabhavanaṃmittratparirdāsati kṣmābhṛnmokṣati

<pṛ0 5a> saṃsṛtirnamativaigarvyaṃtakovaidyati bhogoyogatikalmaṣaṃsukṛtatitvatpādukārcotsavāttvāṃtaṃ
staumidayālumīḍyacaraṇaṃśrīsāhibaṃśaṃkaraṃ (30) diṣṭyātriṃśatipadyahṛdyamaṇibhiḥprotāmahe
