dhruvādibhyohūṃphaṭsvāhā itinaiṛtyāṃaṃgāraṃkṣipya oṃhrīṃraṃsaḥvaiśvānaralohitākṣatrinetrihā

<pṛ0 12a> gaccha jvālāmukhihasaṃnidhehi ihasaṃnirudhyasva ihasaṃmukhībhava hrīṃraṃsaḥsvāhā mūlaṃājyaṃ
tejaḥsamuddiṣṭaṃājyaṃpāpaharaṃparaṃ ājyaṃsvarāṇāmāhāraḥājyelokaḥpratiṣṭhitaḥ divyaṃta
rikṣabhūmīnāṃyattekilviṣamāgataṃ tatsarvamājyadarśenavināśamupagacchatu tatsat adyeti
śrīśārikābhagavatīpuraścaraṇasiddhaye puraścaraṇāṃgabhūtaṃhomaṃ amukakāmanāsiddhaye idamā
jyamarpayāmisvāhā ityājyavīkṣaṇaṃkṛtvā prāṇāhutīdattvā prāṇāyasvāhā apānāyasvā
hā samānāyasvāhā udānāyasvāhā vyānāyasvāhā ṣaḍaṃgāhutīdadyāt oṃhrāṃśrāṃhṛdayā
yanamaḥsvāhā oṃhrīṃśrīṃśirasesvāhā oṃhrūṃśruṃśikhāyaivaṣaṭsvāhā oṃhraiṃśraiṃkavacāyahuṃsvā
hā oṃhrauṃśrauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭsvāhā oṃhraḥśraḥastrāyaphaṭsvāhā tataḥdakṣakareṇahuta
vastugṛhītvā vāmenamālāmādāyahunet mūlaṃ nyūnātiriktamaṃtracakratṛptirastusvāhā
guhyātitarpaṇaṃ mūlaṃ śivamastuyajamānasyacchidraṃmābhūtkadācana devadevyāḥprasādena
rakṣarakṣāstumebhṛśaṃ anenamaṃtrahomenaśrīśārikābhagavatīsāṃgāsāsanāsaparivārāsā
laṃkārāsāyudhāprītāmebhavatusvāhā īśānebhasmasaṃgṛhya jalamitibhasma sthalabhasma

<pṛ0 12ba> agnibhasma || oṃśivamastuyajamānasyacchidramābhūtkadācana itimaṃtratilakaṃkṛtvā oṃmūlaṃ
phaṭvimuṃcāmi phaṭparimokṣyāmi phaṭparivisṛjāmi mūlenāgnaupuṣpāṃjaliṃdatvā visṛjā
gniṃ tarpayet karpūraraktacaṃdanamiśritatāyaiḥ tataḥmārjayetyajamānaśīṣaiḥ tataḥbrāhmaṇabhuktiḥ || 

śrīdaivyaisiddhidāyainamaḥ śrīguraveśivāyoṃnamaḥ śrīgaṇapatayenamonamaḥ adhunāpaddhatiṃvakṣye
śrīśilārcanasaṃyutāṃ gadyapadyamayīṃgopyāṃsakalāgamaniścitāṃ prātaḥkṛtyamakṛtvātuyodevīṃ
bhaktitorcayet tasyapūjātuviphalāśocahīnāyathākriyā tatraśrīmānsādhakobrāhmemuhū
rte śayanatalādutthāya karacaraṇādiprakṣālyācamya nijāsanesamupaviśya nijaśirasi
śvetavarṇādhomukhasahasradalakamalakarṇikāṃtargatacaṃdramaṃḍalasiṃhāsanopari niṣaṇṇaṃ sva
guruṃśuklavarṇaṃśuklālaṃkārabhūṣitaṃ jñānānaṃdamuditamānasaṃ saccidānaṃdavigrahaṃ trinaya
naṃcaturbhujaṃ jñānamudrāpustakavarābhayakaraṃvāmāṃgevāmahastadhṛtakamalayā raktavasanābha
raṇayā svaśaktyādakṣabhujenāliṃgitaṃ sarvadevādidevaṃ sarvatīrthatīrthaṃparamaśivasvarūpaṃśāṃ

<pṛ0 13a> taṃsvaprasannaṃdhyātvā taccaraṇakamalayugalavigaladamṛtadhārayāsvātmānaṃpluptaṃvibhāvya mānasopa
cārairārādhayedyathā laṃpṛthivyātmakaṃgaṃdhaṃsamarpayāminamaḥ haṃākāśātmakaṃpuṣpaṃsamarpayāmi
namaḥ yaṃvāyvātmakaṃdhūpaṃsamarpayāminamaḥ raṃvahnyātmakaṃdīpaṃsamarpayāminamaḥ vaṃamṛtātmakaṃ
nānānaivedyaṃsamarpayāminamaḥ saṃsarvātmakaṃphalamūlatāṃbūlādikaṃsamarpayāminamaḥ oṃaiṃhrīṃśrīṃ
hasakhaphreṃhasarakṣamalavayūṃsahakhaphreṃsahakṣamalavarayūṃhsauṃḥshauṃḥśrīmacchrīamukaścaulānaṃda
nāthaśrīpādukāṃśrīmacchrīamukāṃbāśrīpādūkāṃpūjayāminamaḥ itidaśadhāvimṛśya manasādaṃ
ḍavatpraṇāmaṃkuryāt sahasradalapaṃkajesakalaśītaraśmiprabhaṃ varābhayakarāṃbujaṃvimalagaṃdhapu
ṣpāṃbaraṃ prasannavadanekṣaṇaṃsakaladevatārūpiṇaṃ smareśirasihaṃsagaṃtadabhidhānapūrvaṃguruṃitidhyā
tvā praṇāmamaṃtrānpaṭhet namāmisadguruṃśāṃtaṃpratyakṣaṃśivarūpiṇaṃ śirasāyogapīṭhasthaṃmukti
kāmārthasiddhaye (1) śrīguruṃparamānaṃdaṃvaṃdāmyānaṃdavigrahaṃ yasyasānnidhyamātreṇacidānaṃdāyatepa
raṃ (2) akhaṃḍamaṃḍalākāraṃvyāptaṃyenacarācaraṃ tatpadaṃdarśitaṃyenatasmaiśrīguravenamaḥ prakāśānaṃda
nāthaṃcavimarśānaṃdanāthakaṃ ānaṃdānaṃdanāthaṃcadivyaughaṃgurumaṃḍalaṃ (4) śrījñānānaṃdanāthaṃcaśrī

<pṛ0 13ba> satyānaṃdanāthakaṃ śrīpūrṇānaṃdanāthaṃcasiddhaughānpraṇamāmyahaṃ (5) svabhāvānaṃdanāthaṃcapratibhānaṃda
nāthakaṃ subhagānaṃdanāthaṃcamānavaughāngurūnbhaje (6) ajñānatimirāṃdhasyajñānāṃjanaśalāka
yā cakṣurunmīlitaṃyenatasmaiśrīguravenamaḥ (7) gurubrahmāgururviṣṇurgurusākṣānmaheśvaraḥ guru
revajagatsarvaṃtasmaiśrīguravenamaḥ (8) namastenāthabhagavañśivāyagururūpiṇe vidyāvatārasaṃsi
ddhyaisvīkṛtānekavigraha (9) navāyanavarūpāyaparamārthaikarūpiṇe sarvājñānatamobhedabhānaveci
dghanāyate (10) svataṃtrāyadayākḷptavigrahāyaparātmane parataṃtrāyabhaktānāṃbhavyānāṃbhavyarūpiṇe
(11) vivekināṃvivekāyavimarśāyavimarśināṃ prakāśināṃprakāśāyajñānināṃjñānarūpiṇe
(12) purastātpārśvayoḥpṛṣṭenamaskuryāmuparyadhaḥ sadāmaccittarūpeṇavidhehibhavadāsanaṃ (13) iti
śrīguruṃpraṇamya svaprasannaṃvibhāvya manasātadājñāgṛhītvā mūlādhāresvarṇavarṇacaturdalakama
lakarṇikāṃtargataśṛṃgāṭakāṃtavartitrikoṇapīṭhopariparāṃśaktiṃkuṃḍalinīṃ sarpākārāmūrdhvamukhīṃ
sārdhatrivalayāṃ udyaddinakarasahasrabhāsvarāṃ vidyutkoṭisannibhāṃ visataṃtutanīyasīṃ paṃcāśadva
rṇavigrahāṃ aṣṭātriṃśatkalārūpiṇīṃ tridhāmadhāmānaṃ sarvaprāṇijīvāṃ sarvadevādhidevīṃsakala

<pṛ0 14a> maṃtramātaraṃsuptāṃvibhāvya śrīgurūpadiṣṭanijasahajanādena sacaitanyāṃvidhāya tatracaturṣudaleṣu vaṃnamaḥ
śaṃnamaḥ ṣaṃnamaḥ saṃnamaḥ itipatreṣumadhyemūlenacasaṃpūjya prādakṣiṇyenasaṃpūjya pūrvoktamaṃtreṇa
kamalātkamalaṃnītvā tataḥsvādhiṣṭhāneliṃgamūle vidrumavarṇeṣaḍdalakamaletāṃprāpayya tatrabaṃ 
namaḥ bhaṃnamaḥ maṃnamaḥ yaṃnamaḥ raṃnamaḥ laṃnamaḥ itipatreṣumadhyemūlenacasaṃpūjya tatomaṇipūrakenā 
bhau nīlavarṇedaśadalakamaletāṃnītvā tatra ḍaṃnamaḥ ḍhaṃnamaḥ ṇaṃnamaḥ taṃnamaḥ thaṃnamaḥ daṃnamaḥ dhaṃna
maḥ naṃnamaḥ paṃnamaḥ phaṃnamaḥ itipatreṣu madhyemūlenacasaṃpūjya tato'nāhatevakṣasi kapilavarṇe
dvādaśadalakamaletāṃnītvā tatra kaṃnamaḥ khaṃnamaḥ gaṃnamaḥ ghaṃnamaḥ ṅaṃnamaḥ caṃnamaḥ chaṃnamaḥ jaṃnamaḥ
jhaṃnamaḥ ñaṃnamaḥ ṭaṃnamaḥ ṭhaṃnamaḥ itipattreṣumadhyemūlenacaprapūjya tatoviśuddhaukaṭhe dhūmravarṇeṣoḍa
śadalakamaletāṃnītvā tatra aṃnamaḥ āṃnamaḥ iṃnamaḥ īṃnamaḥ uṃnamaḥ ūṃnamaḥ ṛṃnamaḥ ṛṃnamaḥ ḷṃnamaḥ 
ḹṃnamaḥ eṃnamaḥ aiṃnamaḥ oṃnamaḥ auṃnamaḥ aṃnamaḥ aṃḥnamaḥ itipatreṣumadhyemūlenacasaṃpūjya tatobhrūma
dhyeājñācakrevidyudvarṇedvidalakamaletāṃnītvā tatra haṃnamaḥ kṣaṃnamaḥ itipatrayormadhyemūlenaca 
saṃpūjya tatobrahmaraṃdhragatasahasradalakamalaṃtāprāpayya tatrabiṃdurūpatejomayaparamaśivenasahaika

<pṛ0 14ba> tāṃnītvā tataḥsravatāparamāmṛtenatāṃsaṃtarpya tattanādaśravaṇatatparomuhūrtaṃlayaṃvibhāvya tato'
varohesarvatrasohamitimaṃtreṇa kamalātkamale'varohyamāṇāmājñācakrādikrameṇa teṣuteṣukama
leṣu taistairakṣaraiḥsaṃpūjyamānāṃ tattādādhāratattaddhātutattadvarṇa tattadadhidevatāḥsaṃtarpayaṃtīṃ mūlādhāraṃ 
prāpayya tatraivasvasthānesaṃsthāpayet ityārohāvarohaṇakrameṇa parāṃśaktiṃkuṃḍalinīṃdhyātvā prakā
śamānāṃprathameprayāṇe pratiprayāṇepyamṛtāyamānāṃ aṃtaḥpadavyāmanusaṃcaraṃtīmānaṃdarūpāmavalāṃ
prapadye itistutvā nāhamasminacānyostidhyeyaṃcātranavidyate ānaṃdapadasaṃlīnaṃmanaḥsamarasīgataṃ
tatastattejasāvyāptaṃsvadehaṃviciṃtya tattejasaivapariṇatāṃśrīparadevatāṃdhyātvā mānasopacāraissaṃ
pūjya prāṇāyāmatrayaṃkṛtvā tadvidhiryathā athavihitapadmādyāsanomūlādhārārpitacittavṛtti
rmūlaṃpraṇavaṃvāṣoḍaśavāramuccaran dakṣāṃguṣṭena dakṣanāsāpuṭaṃnirudhya vāmenapavanaṃpūrayet tatasta
mevacatuṣṣaṣṭivāramuccaran dakṣānāmākaniṣṭhābhyāṃ vāmaṃpuṭaṃcanirudhya dvābhyāṃpavanaṃkuṃbhayet ta
tastamevadvātriṃśadvāramuccaran dakṣeṇaśanaiḥpavanaṃrecayet iḍayāpivaṣoḍaśabhiḥpavanaṃkuruṣaṣṭhi
catuṣṭayamaṃtaragaṃ tyajapiṃgalayāśanakaiḥśanakairdaśabhirdaśabhirdaśabhirdvyadhikaiḥ ityekaḥprāṇā

<pṛ0 15a> yāmaḥ eṣevaviparyayeṇakriyamāṇodvitīyaḥ prathamavattṛtīyaḥ itthaṃprāṇāyāmatrayeṇa nira
stasakalakaluṣaṃsvadehaṃdevatārādhanayogyaṃvibhāvya svamūlamaṃtrasya ṛṣyādismaraṇaṃvidadhītaya
thā asyaśrīśārikābhagavatīmaṃtrarājasya śrīmahādevṛṣiḥ triṣṭupchaṃdaḥ śrīśārikābhaga
vatīdevatā śāṃbījaṃ śrīṃśaktiḥ phrāṃkīlakaṃ dharmārthakāmamokṣārtheśrījapeviniyogaḥ itikṛ
tāṃjaliḥ smṛtvānyaset śrīmahādevṛṣayenamaḥ śirasi triṣṭupchaṃdasenamomukhe śrīśārikā
bhagavatīdevatāyainamohṛdi śāṃbījāyanamoguhye śrīśaktayenamaḥpādayoḥ phrāṃkīlakāyana
monābhau dharmārthakāmamokṣārthejapeviniyogaḥsarvāṃgeṣu itiṛṣyādinyāsaḥ athakaranyāsaḥ
oṃhrāṃśrāṃaṃguṣṭhābhyāṃnamaḥ oṃhrīṃśrīṃtarjanībhyāṃsvāhā oṃhrūṃśrūṃmadhyamābhyāṃvaṣaṭ oṃhraiṃśraiṃanāmikābhyāṃ 
hūṃ oṃhrauṃśrauṃkaniṣṭhikābhyāṃvauṣaṭ oṃhraḥśraḥkaratalapṛṣṭhābhyāṃphaṭ oṃhrāṃśrāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ oṃhrīṃ
śrīṃśirasesvāhā oṃhrūṃśrūṃśikhāyaivaṣaṭ oṃhraiṃśraiṃkavacāyahuṃ oṃhrauṃśrauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ oṃhraḥśraḥ
astrāyaphaṭ athadhyānaṃ bālārkakoṭidyutimiṃducūḍāṃvarāsicakrābhayabāhumādyāṃ siṃhādhirū
ḍhāṃśivavāmadevalīnāṃbhajecetasiśārikeśīṃ itisvahṛdayakamaleśrīparadevatāṃsvābhedenadhyā

<pṛ0 15ba> tvā mānasairupacāraiḥsaṃpūjya vakṣyamāṇotkīlanādimaṃtrān śrībhairavamaṃtraṃcajaptvā mālāmādāya
oṃmāṃmālemahāmāyesarvaśaktisvarūpiṇi caturvargastvayinyastastasmānmesiddhidābhava oṃsiddhyai
namaḥ itimanasāgaṃdhādinātāmapisaṃpūjya gaṃavighnaṃkurumāletvaṃ itidakṣakareṇagṛhītvā śi
rasiguruṃśvetavarṇaṃ kaṃṭhepītavarṇaṃmūlavidyāṃ hṛdiyathoktarūpāṃśrīdevīṃdhyāyan yathāśaktijapaṃvi
dhāya japāṃte tvaṃmālesarvadevānāṃprītidāśubhadābhava śubhaṃkuruṣvamebhadreyaśovīryaṃcasarvadā iti 
hṛdaṃtaḥpaṭhitvā mālāṃśirasisaṃsthāpya punarapipūrvavatprāṇāyāmatrayṛṣyādikaraṣaḍaṃganyāsā
nvidhāya guhyātiguhyagoptrītvaṃgṛhāṇāsmatkṛtaṃjapaṃ siddhirbhavatumedevitvatprasādānmaheśvari
ityanenatejomayaṃjapaphalaṃśrīdevīvāmahastesamarpya yonimudrayāpraṇamet prātaḥprabhṛtisāyāṃtaṃ
sāyādiprātaraṃtataḥ yatkaromijagadyonetadastutavapūjanaṃ itinijakṛtyaṃsamarpya svākāryānuṣṭhā
nāya oṃtrailokyacaitanyamayesureśiśrīśāriketvaccaraṇājñayaiva prātaḥsamutthāyatavapriyārthaṃsaṃ
sārayātrāmanuvartayiṣye saṃsārayātrāmanuvartamānaṃśrīśāriketvaccaraṇājñayālaṃ spardhātiraskāra
kalipramādabhayānimāṃmābhibhavaṃtumātaḥ jānāmidharmaṃnacamepravṛttirjānāmyadharmaṃnacamenivṛttiḥ

<pṛ0 16a> tvayāhṛṣikeśihṛdisthayāhaṃyathāniyuktosmitathākaromi itiśrīdevyājñāṃsaṃprārthya mū
lādhārādidvādaśāṃtacakraparyaṃtasthitābhyo gaṇapatiprabhṛtidevatābhyo gurūpadeśajñātaṃsaha
jasiddhamajapājapaṃsamarpayedyathā oṃadyapūrvedyurahorātrācaritamucchvāsaniḥśvāsātmakaṃ ṣaṭ 
śatādhikamekaviṃśatisahasrasaṃkhyākamajapājapaṃ mūlādhārasvādhiṣṭhānamaṇipūrānāhataviśu
ddhājñābrahmaraṃdhreṣu caturdalaṣaḍdaladaśadaladvādaśadalaṣoḍaśadaladvidalasahasradaleṣu svarṇavi
drumanīlapiṃgaladhūmravidyutkarvuravarṇeṣu sthitābhyogaṇapati brahmaviṣṇurudrajīvātmaparamātmā
śrīgurupādukābhyo yathābhāgaśaḥsamarpayāmi itikṛtāṃjaliḥsaṃkalpyasamarpayet oṃaiṃhrīṃ
śrīṃmūladhāracakrasthāyagaṇapataye'japājapānāṃṣaṭśatānisamarpayāminamaḥ dhaṃ svādhiṣṭhāna
cakrasthāyabrahmaṇe'japājapānāṃṣaṭsahasrāṇisamarpayāminamaḥ dhaṃ maṇipūrakacakrasthāya
viṣṇave'japājapānāṃṣaṭsahasrāṇisamarpayāminamaḥ dhaṃ anāhatacakrasthāyarudrāyā'japāja
pānāṃṣaṭsahasrāṇisamarpayāminamaḥ dhaṃ viśuddhacakrasthāyajīvātmane'japājapānāṃ
sahasraṃsamarpayāminamaḥ dhaṃājñācakrasthāyaparamātmane'japājapānāṃsahasraṃsamarpayāmi

<pṛ0 16ba> namaḥ dhaṃsahasradalakamalakarṇikāmadhyavartinyaiśrīgurupādukāyaiajapājapānāṃsahasraṃ
samarpayāminamaḥ ityajapājapaṃsamarpya oṃadyasūryodayamārabhya āgāmisūryodayaṃyāvat
ahorātreṇocchvāsaniḥśvāsātmakaṃ ṣaṭśatādhikamekaviṃśatisahasrasaṃkhyākamajapā
japamahaṃkariṣye itikṛtāṃjaliḥsaṃkalpya ajapāmaṃtreṇaprāṇāyāmaṃvidhāya asyaśrī
ajapāgāyatrīmaṃtrasya haṃsṛṣiḥ avyaktagāyatrīchaṃdaḥ paramātmādevatā haṃbījaṃ saḥ
śaktiḥ sohaṃkīlakaṃ mamamuktisādhanejapeviniyogaḥ svaśirasi dhaṃhaṃsātmaneṛṣaye
namaḥ mukhe dhaṃavyaktagāyatrīcchaṃdasenamaḥ hṛdaye dhaṃparamātmadevatāyainamaḥ mūlādhāre dhaṃ
haṃbījāyanamaḥ pādayoḥ dhaṃsaḥśaktayenamaḥ nābhaudhaṃsohaṃkīlakāyanamaḥ hṛdi dhaṃoṃkā
ratattvāyanamaḥ kaṃṭhe dhaṃ udāttāyasvarāyanamaḥ mūrdhni dhaṃnabhasesthānāyanamaḥ dhaṃhaimāyava
rṇāyanamaḥ itivinyasya mamamokṣārthejapeviniyogaḥ itikṛtāṃjalirvadet dhaṃhsāṃsū
ryātmanesvāhāṃguṣṭhābhyāṃnamaḥ dhaṃhsīṃsomātmanesvāhātarjanībhyāṃsvāhā dhaṃhsūṃniraṃja
nātmanesvāhāmadhyamābhyāṃvaṣaṭ dhaṃhsaiṃnirābhāsātmanesvāhānāmikābhyāṃhuṃ dhaṃhsauṃḥ

<pṛ0 17a> anaṃtatanuḥsūkṣmādevīpracodayātsvāhā kaniṣṭhikābhyāṃvauṣaṭ dhaṃhsaṃḥavyaktabodhātmanesvā
hākaratalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃphaṭ itikaranyāsaḥ dhaṃhsāṃsūryātmanesvāhāhṛdayāyanamaḥ dhaṃ
