namaḥjānuni daṃnamaḥgulphe dhaṃnamaḥaṃgulimūle naṃnamaḥaṃgulyagre paṃnamaḥdakṣapārśve phaṃnamaḥvā
me baṃnamaḥpṛṣṭhe bhaṃnamaḥnābhau maṃnamaḥjaṭhare yaṃtvagātmanenamaḥhṛdaye raṃasṛgātmanenamaḥdakṣāṃ
se laṃmāṃsātmanenamaḥkakudi vaṃmedasātmanenamaḥ vāmāṃse śaṃasthyātmanenamaḥhṛdādida
kṣapāṇyaṃtaṃ ṣaṃmajjātmanenamaḥhṛdādivāmapāṇyaṃtaṃ saṃśukrātmanenamaḥhṛdādidakṣapādāṃtaṃ

<pṛ0 22ba> haṃprāṇātmanenamaḥhṛdādivāmapādāṃtaṃ laṃjīvātmanenamaḥpādādinābhyaṃtaṃ kṣaṃḥparamātmane
namaḥnābhyādimūrdhāṃtaṃ itivinyasya paṃcāśadvarṇarūpāṃcakapardaśaśibhūṣaṇāṃ śuddhaspha
ṭikasaṃkāśāṃśuddhakṣaumavirājitāṃ muktāratnasphuradbhūṣāṃjapamālāṃkamaṃḍaluṃ pustakaṃvara
dānaṃcavibhratīṃparameśvarīṃ evaṃdhyātvāmātṛkāṃ svamūḷṣyādinyāsaṃkuryādyathā athata
ttvanyāsaḥ oṃātmatattvāyanamaḥhṛdayāyanamaḥ oṃvidyātattvāyanamaḥśirasesvāhā
oṃśivatattvāyanamaḥśikhāyaivaṣaṭ oṃgurutattvāyanamaḥkavacāyahuṃ oṃśaktitattvāya
namaḥnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ oṃśivaśaktitattvāyanamaḥastrāyaphaṭ ititattvanyāsaḥ a
thamaṃtranyāsaḥ oṃnamaḥoṃnamaḥśirasihrīṃnamaḥlalāṭeśrīṃnamaḥnetrayoḥhūṃnamaḥkarṇayoḥ
phrāṃnamaḥnāsāgre āṃnamaḥmukhe śāṃnamaḥkaṃṭhe śāṃnamaḥvakṣasi riṃnamaḥbhujayoḥ kāṃ na
maḥnābhau yaiṃnamaḥliṃgenaṃnamaḥjānvanoḥ maḥnamaḥpādayoḥ itisaptadhāvyāpayon iti
maṃtranyāsaḥ athāṣṭadevīnyāsaḥ aṃāṃiṃīṃkaṃkhaṃgaṃghaṃṅaṃamāyainamaḥśirasi uṃūṃṛṃṛ
caṃchaṃjaṃjhaṃñaṃkāmāyainamaḥmukhe ḷṃḹṃeṃaiṃṭaṃṭhaṃḍaṃḍhaṃṇaṃcārvāṃgyainamaḥkaṃṭhe oṃauṃaṃaṃḥtaṃthaṃ

<pṛ0 23a> daṃdhaṃnaṃṭaṃkadhāriṇyainamaḥvakṣasi aṃāṃiṃīṃpaṃphaṃbaṃbhaṃmaṃtārāyainamaḥnābhau uṃūṃṛṃṛyaṃraṃ
laṃvaṃpārvatyainamaḥliṃge ḷṃḹṃeṃaiṃśaṃṣaṃsaṃhaṃrukmiṇyainamaḥjānvoḥ oṃauṃaṃaḥlaṃkṣaṃśi
vāyainamaḥpādayoḥ ityaṣṭadevīnyāsaḥ athāyudhanyāsaḥ varāyanamaḥdakṣādhaḥkare khaḍgā
yanamaḥdakṣe cakrāyanamaḥvāme abhayāyanamaḥvāmoghaḥ ityāyudhanyāsaḥ tataḥpunaḥṣa
ḍaṃganyāsaḥsaṃpradāyena oṃhrāṃśrāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ oṃhrīṃśrīṃśirasesvāhā oṃhrūṃśrūṃśikhā
yaivaṣaṭ oṃhraiṃśraiṃkavacāyahuṃoṃhrauṃśrauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ oṃhraḥśraḥastrāyaphaṭ itinyā
sairdehaṃvinyasya mūlādhāremūlavidyāṃvidyutkoṭisamaprabhāṃ sūryakoṭipratīkāśāṃcaṃdra
koṭiprabhāṃpriye visataṃtusvarūpāṃtāṃbiṃdutrivalayāṃpriye ūrdhvaśaktinipātenasahaje
navarānane mūlaśaktidṛḍhatvenamadhyaśaktiprabodhataḥ paramānaṃdasaṃdohamānaṃdāciṃtaye
tparāṃ śrīdevīṃpūrvoktaprakāreṇasvahṛtkamaledhyātvā mānasopacārairārādhya naivedyā
vasareṃ'tavaiśvadaivataṃkuryādyathā mūlādhāre ātmāṃtarātmaparamātmajñānātmetyātmacatuṣṭayaṃ
sacaturaśraṃkuṃḍalyagnisamujvalaṃkuṃḍaṃdhyātvā tatraśrīdevīṃdhyātvā tanmukhemūlāṃteahaṃtāṃ

<pṛ0 23ba> juhomisvāhā ityādyahaṃtāmasatyaṃpaiśunyaṃkāmaṃkrodhaṃlobhaṃmohaṃmadaṃmātsaryaṃjuhomisvāhā
suṣumṇāsruṅmuktamanaḥsruveṇapratyekaṃhutvā athavā dharmādharmahavirdīptesvātmāgnaumana
sāsrucā suṣumṇāvartmanānityamakṣavṛttījuhomyahaṃ itihutvā punaḥhṛdayakamaledevīṃ
dhyātvā uttarāyośānādisarvopacārairārādhya mūlaṃyathāśaktijapitvā prāṇāyāmādi
nājapaṃsamarpya śrīguruṃpraṇamya pīṭhapūjāṃnyāsenasvadehekuryāt oṃmuḍukāyanamaḥ kālā
gnirudrāyanamaḥ mūlaprakṛtyainamaḥ ādhāraśaktyainamaḥ kamaṭhāyanamaḥ anaṃtāyanamaḥ pṛthi
vyainamaḥ sudhārṇavāyanamaḥ ratnadvīpāyanamaḥ kalpavanāyanamaḥ naṃdanodyānāyanamaḥ ciṃ
tāmaṇimaṃḍapāyanamaḥ maṇivedikāyainamaḥ śmaśānāyanamaḥ ratnasiṃhāsanāyanamaḥ
dikṣuḥ nānāmunigaṇebhyonamaḥ nānādevebhyonamaḥ dharmāyanamaḥ dakṣāṃse jñānāyanamaḥ vā
māṃse vairāgyāyanamaḥ vāmorau aiśvaryāyanamaḥdakṣorau adharmāyanamaḥ dakṣakukṣau ajñānāyana
maḥdakṣapṛṣṭhe avairāgyāyanamaḥvāmapṛṣṭhe anaiśvaryāyanamaḥvāmakukṣau śeṣāyanamaḥ padmā
yanamaḥ prakṛtimayapatrebhyonamaḥ vikṛtimayakesarebhyonamaḥ paṃcāśadvījabhūṣitakarṇi

<pṛ0 24a> kāyainamaḥ sūryamaṃḍalāyanamaḥ somamaṃḍalāyanamaḥ vaiśvānaramaṃḍalāyanamaḥ saṃsattvāyanamaḥ
raṃrajasenamaḥ taṃtamasenamaḥ āṃātmanenamaḥ aṃaṃtarātmanenamaḥ paṃparamātmanenamaḥ hrīṃ
jñānātmanenamaḥ pattreṣu vāmāyainamaḥjyeṣṭhāyainamaḥ raudryainamaḥ aṃbikāyainamaḥ icchāyaina
maḥ jñānāyainamaḥ kriyāyainamaḥ kubjikāyainamaḥ cittrāyainamaḥ viṣaghnikāyainamaḥ hūtaryai
namaḥ ānaṃdāyainamaḥmadhye manonmanyainamaḥ aiṃparāyainamaḥ aparāyainamaḥ virūpāyainamaḥ
hsauṃḥsadāśivamahāpretapadmāsanāyanamaḥ itipīṭhaṃvinyasya tatraivahṛdayesvābhedenaśrīśā
rikābhagavatīṃdhyāyan bālārkakoṭidyutimiṃducūḍāṃvarāsicakrābhayabāhumādyāṃ siṃ
hādhirūḍhāṃśivavāmadevalīnāṃbhajecetasiśārikeśīṃ itiśārikāṃviciṃtya vadhnāmi
kaṃkaṇaṃtebaddhamatirbhavabhavocchittyaiprāṇāpānaucakraśrottreghrāṇamanāṃsisukhaṃciraṃti
ṣṭhaṃtusvāhā mānasopacārairārādhya manasāyathāśaktijapahomādikaṃvidhāya kāmaka
lārūpaṃsvātmānaṃviciṃtya svadehaṃgaṃdhādibhiralaṃkṛtya kalaśasthāpanaṃkuryāt svadakṣe
trikoṇaṃvṛttabiṃbamaṃḍalaṃbhūmauviracayya tatrādhāraśaktayenamaḥ itisaṃpūjya tatrādhāraṃ

<pṛ0 24ba> nidhāya tadupariastrāyaphaṭ itimaṃtreṇaśodhitaṃ namaḥ itipūritaṃ pātraṃśaṃkhāṃvā saṃ
sthāpya tatragaṃgeityāditīrthamāvāhya omitigaṃdhādinnikṣipya vahnisūryasomakalā
bhyonamaḥ itisaṃpūjya dhenumudrāṃpradarśyasvamaṃtreṇasaṃpūjayet itisāmānyārghyaṃvidhā
ya svavāmabhāgeṣaṭkoṇāṃtargatatrikoṇadvayabiṃduvāhya vṛttacaturaśraṃvidhāya sā
mānyārghyodakena taṃmaṃḍalemabhyukṣya tatrādhāraśaktibhyonamaḥ ityādhāraśaktīḥsampū
jya tatrādhāraṃprakṣālya maṃḍaloparisaṃsthāpya raṃvahnimaṃḍalāyadaśakalātmanenamaḥ 
itiprapūjya phaḍitikalaśaṃprakṣālya kāraṇenaprapūrya raktavastramālyādināsaṃbhūṣya
devībuddhyāsaṃsthāpya aṃarkamaṃḍalāyadvādaśakalātmanenamaḥ itikalaśaṃsaṃpūjya
oṃsomamaṃḍalāyaṣoḍaśakalātmanenamaḥ itidravyaṃsaṃpūjya phaḍitisaṃrakṣya humitya
vaguṃṭhya mūlenasaṃvīkṣya namityabhyukṣya mūlenagaṃdhamāghrāya kuṃbhepuṣpaṃdattvā śāpa
mocanaṃkuryāt ekamevaparaṃbrahmasthūlasūkṣmamayaṃdhruvaṃ kacodbhavāṃbrahmahatyāṃtenate
nāśayāmyahaṃ sūryamaṃḍalasaṃbhūtevaruṇālayasaṃbhave amābījamayedeviśukraśāpā

<pṛ0 25a> dvimucyatāṃ vedānāṃpraṇavobījaṃbrahmānaṃdamayoyadi tenasatyenahedevibrahmahatyāvya
pohatu ititriḥ tataḥbāṃbīṃbūṃbaiṃbauṃbaḥbrahmaśāpamocitāyaisurādaivyainamaḥ itya
pitriḥ oṃhrīṃśrīṃkrāṃkrīṃkrūṃkraiṃkrauṃkraḥsurākṛṣṇaśāpamocaya(2)amṛtaṃsrāvaya(2)svā
hā ititriḥ haṃsaḥśuciṣadvasuraṃtarikṣasaddhotāvediṣadatithirduroṇasatnṛṣadvarasanṛ
tasadvyomasadabjāgojāṛtajādrijāṛtaṃ ityapitriḥ ānaṃdabhairavaṃaṣṭādaśabhujaṃtrina
yanaṃpaṃcamukhaṃsurādevīsahitaṃdhyātvā hasarakṣamalavayūṃānaṃdabhairavāyavauṣaṭ saha
kṣamalavarayūṃsurādaivyaivauṣaṭ itidevadevyautriḥsaṃpūjya dravyamadhyedakṣiṇāvartenatriḥ
paṃktyā aṃ(16) kaṃ(16) thaṃ(16) itiśakticakraṃvilikhya tanmadhyehaṃkṣaṃca tedravyamadhye'
mṛtaṃviciṃtya dhenumudrayāmṛtīkṛtya vamitisudhābījaṃmūlamapyaṣṭadhāghaṭaṃdhṛtvāpaṭhi
tvā ātmaśrīcakrayormadhyetrikoṇaṣaṭkoṇavṛttacaturaśraṃvilikhya caturaśrepūrṇagi
ripīṭhāyanamaḥ uḍḍiyānapīṭhāyanamaḥ kāmarūpapīṭhāyanamaḥ jālaṃdharapīṭhāyana
maḥ itisaṃpūjya ṣaṭkoṇeṣaḍaṃgaṃsaṃpūjya trikhaṃḍenatrikoṇāgradakṣottaraṃsaṃpūjya madhyeā

<pṛ0 25ba> dhāraśaktyainamaḥ itisaṃpūjya trikoṇagarbheyaṃtrikāṃsaṃsthāpya namitisāmānyārghyajalenābhyukṣya
yaṃdhūmrārciṣenamaḥ raṃūṣmāyainamaḥ laṃjvalinyainamaḥ vaṃjvālinyainamaḥ śaṃvisphuliṃginyainamaḥ
ṣaṃsuśriyainamaḥ saṃsvarūpāyainamaḥ haṃkapilāyainamaḥ laṃhavyavāhāyainamaḥ kṣaṃkavyavāhāyainamaḥ 
itisaṃpūjya madhye raṃvahnimaṃḍalāyadaśakalātmanenamaḥ itisaṃpūjya ṣaṭkoṇeṣaḍaṃgaṃcasaṃ
pūjya madhyemūlenadevīṃsaṃpūjya pātraṃphaḍitiprakṣālya yaṃtrikoparisaṃsthāpya tatra kaṃbhaṃta
pinyainamaḥ khaṃbaṃtāpinyainamaḥ gaṃphaṃdhūmrāyainamaḥ ghaṃpaṃmarīcyainamaḥ ṅaṃnaṃjvalinyainamaḥ caṃ
dhaṃrucyainamaḥ chaṃdaṃsuprabhāyainamaḥ jaṃthaṃbhogadāyainamaḥ jhaṃtaṃviśvāyainamaḥ ñaṃṇaṃbodhinyaina
maḥ ṭaṃḍhaṃdhāriṇyainamaḥ ṭhaṃḍaṃkṣamāyainamaḥ iti aṃarkamaṃḍalāyadvādaśakalātmanenamaḥ
itisaṃpūjya trikoṇavṛttaṣaṭkoṇaṃpātrevilikhya samastavyastamaṃtreṇasaṃpūjya varuṇabī
jaṃmūlaṃvilomamātṛkāṃcapaṭhanna'mṛtenatrikoṇaṃprapūrya jalenacabhāgamekaṃprapūrya tatra
sugaṃdhādinikṣipya aṃamṛtāyainamaḥ āṃānaṃdāyainamaḥ iṃpūṣāyainamaḥ īṃtuṣṭyainamaḥ
uṃpuṣṭyainamaḥ ūṃratyainamaḥ ṛṃdhṛtyainamaḥ ṛṃśaśinyainamaḥ ḷṃcaṃdrikāyainamaḥ ḹṃkāṃtyainamaḥ

<pṛ0 26a> eṃjyotsnāyainamaḥ aiṃśriyainamaḥ oṃprītyainamaḥ auṃaṃgadāyainamaḥ aṃpūrṇāyainamaḥ aṃḥpūrṇā
mṛtāyainamaḥ iti uṃṣoḍaśakalātmanesomamaṃḍalāyanamaḥ itisaṃpūjya pūrvavadyaṃtraṃdravye
vilikhya trikoṇaṃtrirekhāyāṃ aṃ(16) kaṃ(16) thaṃ(16) ititrivilikhya mūlaṃ khaṃḍatrayeṇatri
koṇaṃsaṃpūjya ṣaṭkoṇeṣaḍaṃgaṃca gaṃgetyāditīrthamāvāhya ānaṃdabhairavabhairavyausumaṃtreṇa 
saṃpūjya pūrvāditaṃḥ glūṃgaganaratnebhyonamaḥ pūrve slūṃsvarṇaratnebhyonamaḥ dakṣiṇe mlūṃmartyara
tnebhyonamaḥ paścime plūṃpātālaratnebhyonamaḥ uttare nlūṃnāgaratnebhyonamaḥ madhye itisaṃpūjya
māṃsādisaṃśodhayet yathātatra māṃsādipātramānīya astrāyaphaḍitisāmānyārghodakenā
bhyukṣya humityavaguṃṭhya vamityamṛtamudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya tālatrayeṇadiśaḥsaṃbaṃdhya taduparimūlaṃ
saptadhāprajapya pratadviṣṇustavatevīryeṇamṛgonabhīmaḥkvacarogariṣṭaḥ yasyoruṣutriṣuvikrama
ṇeṣvadhikṣayaṃtibhuvanāniviśvā ititriḥ itimāṃsaśodhanaṃ tryaṃbakaṃyajāmahesugaṃdhiṃpuṣṭiva
rdhanaṃ urvārukamivabaṃdhanānmṛtyormokṣīyamāmṛtāt itimīnaśodhanaṃ tadviṣṇoḥparamaṃpadaṃsadā
paśyaṃtisūrayaḥ divīvacakṣurātataṃtadviprāsovipaṇyavo jāgṛvāṃsaḥsamindhateviṣṇoryatpa

<pṛ0 26ba> ramaṃpadaṃ itimudrāśodhanaṃ viṣṇuryoniṃkalpayatutuṣṭārūpāṇiviṃśatu āsiṃcatuprajāpati
rdhātāgarbhaṃdadhātute garbhaṃdehisinīvālīgarbhaṃdehisarasvati garbhaṃdehyaśvinaudevāvādattaṃpu
ṣkarasrajaṃ oṃaiṃhsaṃḥphreṃjvaṃsaḥamṛte'mṛtodbhave'mṛtavarṣiṇiamṛtaṃsrāvaya(2)svāhāiti
kuṃḍagolādikaṃsaṃśodhya avaguṃṭhya amṛtamudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya taduparisaptadhāmūlaṃsaṃpūjya
tatradevīmāvāhya tālatrayadigbaṃdhaṃvidhāya avaguṃṭhya'mṛtīkṛtya yoniṃpradarśya hsauṃḥnamaḥ
itisaṃpūjya śaṃkhamudrāṃpradarśya ṣaḍaṃgenasakalīkṛtya matsyamudrayāpātramācchādya mūlaṃdaśa
dhājaptvā pātraṃdevīrūpaṃvibhāvayet ititatodevyājñāmādāya ghaṭasamīpegurupātraṃ tataḥśa
ktipātraṃ bhogapātraṃ svapātraṃ yoginīpātraṃ vīrapātraṃ balipātraṃ pādyapātraṃ arghyapātraṃ āca
manīyapātraṃ madhuparkapātraṃsaṃsthāpya carvaṇayutakāraṇenatattvamudrayā śrīpātrādvindūṃsamuddhṛtya
ānaṃdabhairavaṃtarpayāminamaḥ ititanmaṃtreṇatriḥsaṃtarpya tataḥguruṃśrīmacchrīamukānaṃdanātha
śrīpādukāṃtarpayāminamaḥ ititriḥsaṃtarpya evaṃparamaguruparamācāryādīnsaṃtarpya śrīpātrāmṛ
tenamūlenadevīsāyudhāṃsavāhanāṃsaparikarāṃtarpayāminamaḥ itisaṃtarpayetitikalaśapū

<pṛ0 27a> jāvidhiḥ athapīṭhoparipūrvavatpīṭhanyāsakrameṇapīṭhapūjāṃkṛtvā tatraśrīcakraṃsaṃsthā
pya śrīśārikābhagavatīṃdhyātvā vāyubījenavāmanāsāpuṭenasvahṛdayākusumāṃjali
mānīya tatrāvāhya deveśibhaktasulabheparivārasamanvite yāvattvāṃpūjayiṣyāmitāvaddevi
ihāvaha itipaṭhitvā mūlaṃśrīvāmadevasahiteśrīśārikābhagavatiihāgaccha(2)ihati
ṣṭha(2) ihasannidhehi(2) ihasanniruddhasvamamasarvopacārasahitāṃpūjāṃgṛhṇa(2) ityāvāhanādi
mudrāḥpradarśya prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃśrīcakrelelihānamudrayāpūrvavadvidhāya daśadigbaṃdhaṃkṛtvā'
vaguṃṭhya sakalīkṛtyaparamīkṛtya dhenuyonīpradarśya varāsicakrābhayamudrāḥpradarśya śrī
pātrāmṛtenasāyudhāṃsavāhanāṃsaparikarāṃsāvaraṇāṃśrīvāmadevabhairavasahitāṃśrīśārikā
bhagavatīṃtarpayāminamaḥ ititriḥsaṃtarpya punarapimūlenaśrīśārikābhagavatīśrīpādu
kāṃtarpayāminamaḥ ititriḥsaṃtarpya mūlamuccāryetatpādyaṃ śrīvāmadevasahitaśrīśāri
kābhagavatyainamaḥ itipādayoḥpādyaṃ evamarghyaṃsvāhā śirasi ācamanīyaṃ madhuparkaṃca
sudhā mukhesnānīyaṃnamaḥ sarvāṃge pādukeparidhāyasvaśārikeratnanirmite snānamaṃḍapa

<pṛ0 27ba> māyāhisnānārthaṃśakradiggataṃ mūlenasusnāpya punaḥpunaḥpādukeparidhāyasvaśārikera
tnanirmite āgacchanirmitaṃramyamalaṃkārasyamaṃḍapaṃ śuddhadugūlenāṃgaṃproṃcchya vicitrapaṭa
